        "raw": "<p>Hello,</p><p>I apologize if this is posted somewhere.&nbsp; One thing I really found myself missing in the rulebook was a basic kind of &quot;Start&quot; here and run this scenario or just take these two characters and do this.&nbsp; I also found that a missing setup section left me wondering if I had really set the game up correctly.&nbsp; So I put it back in the box and decided to ask.&nbsp; What is the best scenario to start with?</p><p>Thanks</p><p>Pat</p>",
